{"seq":4,"slug":"grid-scale-storage","title":"电网级储能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/grid-scale-storage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"electrochemical-storage-stations","title":"电化学储能电站","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/grid-scale-storage/electrochemical-storage-stations","wordCount":1817,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"flow-batteries","title":"液流电池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/grid-scale-storage/flow-batteries","wordCount":1900,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"physical-storage-frontiers","title":"物理储能前沿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/grid-scale-storage/physical-storage-frontiers","wordCount":2210,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"电网级储能\">电网级储能</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>随着可再生能源渗透率突破 30%，电网级储能从&quot;可选&quot;变为&quot;必选&quot;。本章覆盖抽水蓄能之外的新型大规模储能技术：电化学储能电站的设计与经济性、液流电池的长时储能优势，以及压缩空气/重力等物理储能前沿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序号</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>电化学储能电站</td>\n<td>磷酸铁锂储能系统设计、度电成本（LCOS）、安全标准、商业模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>液流电池</td>\n<td>全钒液流/铁铬液流/锌溴液流、功率-容量解耦、长时储能优势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>物理储能前沿</td>\n<td>压缩空气储能（CAES/LAES）、重力储能、飞轮储能、储能技术选型框架</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键概念\">关键概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>LCOS（Levelized Cost of Storage）</strong>：储能度电成本，衡量储能系统全生命周期经济性</li>\n<li><strong>功率-容量解耦</strong>：液流电池可独立扩展功率（电堆面积）和容量（电解液体积）</li>\n<li><strong>长时储能（LDES）</strong>：放电时长≥4小时（通常8-100+小时）的储能系统</li>\n</ul>\n"}